# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets redirect rules for sports.com.na.
#
# Parsed by the asset layer at deploy time — INVALID RULES FAIL THE DEPLOY.
# Cloudflare syntax, not Netlify: no `!` force suffix, and no `/* /index.html`
# catch-all (that is rejected as an infinite loop; the SPA fallback comes from
# `not_found_handling: "single-page-application"` in wrangler.jsonc).
#
# ── Why this file exists ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Until the cutover, sports.com.na served the DOME X athlete system, not this
# site. Existing bookmarks, and form links already emailed / WhatsApp'd to
# athletes, point at DOME X paths on this apex. After the swap those paths mean
# nothing here, so they are sent to system.sports.com.na instead.
#
# These MUST live in _redirects rather than Worker code: wrangler.jsonc sets
# `run_worker_first: ["/api/*"]`, so a non-API path never invokes the Worker —
# it would be answered by the SPA shell with HTTP 200 and the redirect would
# never run.
#
# ── Deliberately NOT redirected (namespace collisions) ───────────────────────
#   /admin   — this site routes /admin (super-admin dashboard). DOME X also has
#              /admin and /admin/*. This site wins on the apex.
#   /login   — both apps have /login. This site wins.
# DOME X staff reach those directly on system.sports.com.na.

# Athlete-facing form submission links. Highest priority: these are sent out in
# email and WhatsApp messages and are already in the wild.
/submit/*        https://system.sports.com.na/submit/:splat        301

# Athlete portal.
/portal          https://system.sports.com.na/portal               301
/portal/*        https://system.sports.com.na/portal/:splat        301

# Coach / staff application surfaces.
/dashboard       https://system.sports.com.na/dashboard            301
/hpc/*           https://system.sports.com.na/hpc/:splat           301
/calendar        https://system.sports.com.na/calendar             301
/reports         https://system.sports.com.na/reports              301
/settings/*      https://system.sports.com.na/settings/:splat      301
/federations     https://system.sports.com.na/federations          301
/bot             https://system.sports.com.na/bot                  301

# Help, legal and marketing pages that belonged to DOME X on this apex.
/help/*          https://system.sports.com.na/help/:splat          301
/presentation    https://system.sports.com.na/presentation         301
/privacy         https://system.sports.com.na/privacy              301
/terms           https://system.sports.com.na/terms                301
